WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.600
Hi there again.

2
00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.800
There is still something
you won't find in my CV.

3
00:00:05.053 --> 00:00:07.983
Until I was seven,
I grew up on a farm in Poland.

4
00:00:08.253 --> 00:00:10.153
Well, water came from a pump.

5
00:00:10.533 --> 00:00:13.483
The only screen was my grandparents'
black-and-white TV.

6
00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.600
In 1992 we moved to Hamburg.

7
00:00:16.847 --> 00:00:21.167
A few years later,
an old PC, Need for Speed

8
00:00:21.227 --> 00:00:25.887
and GTA 1 got me hooked.

9
00:00:26.187 --> 00:00:28.717
I played it a lot, especially GTA.

10
00:00:28.947 --> 00:00:31.367
GTA 6 just came out. It's great.

11
00:00:32.247 --> 00:00:35.717
And at fourteen I knew
I wanted to build software.

12
00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.950
After university I spent
two years in Australia,

13
00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:43.080
on farms with chickens, on building sites,

14
00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:46.150
and three months picking flowers
in the middle of nowhere,

15
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.550
with kangaroos hopping past my door.

16
00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:51.350
I also planted thousands of trees

17
00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:54.450
where trees were missing in forests.

18
00:00:54.817 --> 00:00:57.547
Today, well, I'm a dad,

19
00:00:58.437 --> 00:01:01.127
I train calisthenics a few times a week

20
00:01:01.847 --> 00:01:03.687
and I'm learning Korean.

21
00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:08.400
I still love the moment
when something I've built just works.

22
00:01:08.647 --> 00:01:12.617
Enjoy your day, and talk to you soon. Bye.
